        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
          <span class="icon">🏠</span>
          <div class="info-text">
            <h4>집</h4>
            <p>인천광역시 서구</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
          <span class="icon">📧</span>
          <div class="info-text">
